# Intentionally minimal.
#
# The previous npm-only settings are gone: `legacy-peer-deps` (pnpm is strict by
# default and does not read the flag) and `package-lock` (this repo uses
# pnpm-lock.yaml). Their pnpm equivalents, where still needed, live in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml so that the `npm view` calls in .github/scripts do not warn
# about unknown config keys.
#
# Kept as an empty file rather than deleted so the reasoning above survives.
